diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 075fd17..0c4598c 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,6 +9,10 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Queue management page (`entity.queues`, owner/admin): list, create, rename, activate/deactivate with an in-page confirmation, and per-queue `call` access grants through `SetQueueAccess`. Every id is resolved scoped to the current entity.
+- Attendant serve panel (`entity.serve`, any member): selects a callable queue, shows its waiting list in call order, and calls the next ticket through `CallNextTicket` with the `any` / `priority_only` / `normal_only` modes (successful calls rate-limited to 10 per minute per user and entity).
+- Members page is split into `Members` and `Invites` tabs; the invite form and pending invites live on the invites tab only.
+- Navbar entries for Queues (managers) and Serve (members), with `pt_BR` and `en` translations.
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
